  "what_this_is": "The decisive numbers from W1-30B's hardware evidence, pinned because reports/.gitignore excludes run artifacts by rule and these are 180 KB of JSON that a fresh clone would not have. Every figure below is copied verbatim from the raw file named beside it; the SHA-256 of each raw file is recorded so a regenerated copy that drifts is caught.",
